  "operative_text": "SECTION 2 (HRS 134C-1): The administrative head of the office shall be a director, who shall be nominated and appointed by the governor. The office may employ analysts, grant writers, and other staff necessary for the purposes of the office.\nSECTION 3 (HRS 134C-3): Develop programs and make recommendations to the governor and legislature to prevent and minimize the risk of gun violence in the State.\nSECTION 5 (new): The sum appropriated shall be expended by the department of the attorney general for the purposes of this Act."
